       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 5000 mg three times daily is 15 g/day, almost four times the usual maximum of 4 g/day for an adult. A dose that high risks serious hepatotoxicity and liver failure. It may be a typo for 500 mg, or possibly 650 mg or 1000 mg.\n\nWhich of these did you intend?\n\n- **500 mg PO three times daily** (1.5 g/day)\n- **650 mg PO three times daily** (about 2 g/day)\n- **1000 mg PO three times daily** (3 g/day, within the 4 g/day limit)\n- Another dose\n\nIf you confirm the dose, I'll enter it right away. It's also worth checking the plan with your resident or supervising physician."
